DECLARE Party IS ONE OF Borrower, Lender
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF Pay HAS payer IS A Party, to IS A Party, amount IS A NUMBER

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
`may pay, lest breach` MEANS
  PARTY Borrower
  MAY Pay Borrower Lender 10
  WITHIN 5
  HENCE FULFILLED
  LEST BREACH

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
`may pay, no lest` MEANS
  PARTY Borrower
  MAY Pay Borrower Lender 10
  WITHIN 5
  HENCE FULFILLED

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
`must pay, lest breach` MEANS
  PARTY Borrower
  MUST Pay Borrower Lender 10
  WITHIN 5
  HENCE FULFILLED
  LEST BREACH

-- 1: may, lest breach, paid late
#TRACE `may pay, lest breach` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Borrower DOES Pay Borrower Lender 10 AT 9

-- 2: may, no lest, paid late
#TRACE `may pay, no lest` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Borrower DOES Pay Borrower Lender 10 AT 9

-- 3: must, lest breach, paid late
#TRACE `must pay, lest breach` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Borrower DOES Pay Borrower Lender 10 AT 9

-- 4: may, lest breach, paid in time
#TRACE `may pay, lest breach` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Borrower DOES Pay Borrower Lender 10 AT 3
